                                 rdfs:label "Approach Speed Test Process" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/shannon/ontologies/2026/8/CORE#Classification_Category_Designation
CORE:Classification_Category_Designation rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                         rdfs:subClassOf www:ont00000686 ;
